{
  "id": "52",
  "title": "心镜歌",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“心镜歌”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "人生富贵皆前定，术士须详论；天上星辰有可加，此说更无差。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-866b26a476597ff2a03f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时年月建逢命位，正是福元取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-39dc504fcce02bc19b9c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "寿元合处是无真，此说不虚陈。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-e225c136ce74de51bd9a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官禄贵马见合刑，一举便成名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-00a3254c31a37a01ede0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日逢贵地见禄马，壮岁登科甲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-4ab5883e0f02f770d559-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时日若逢禄马位，为官必清贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-cd5a878b29a35227e3f7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行时日无相杂，为官多显达。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-25c5a042032779703c51-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃重重又见杀，大贵登科甲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-31adf11ec64a53ebeb55-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若逢三奇连禄马，名誉满天下。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-2e64cda178a348bca963-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日坐食支又合干，九卿三公看。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-2c3cc5a754567d419c4d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲子己巳有一说，天德得合诀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-9d9bc8c108676ebfb1ad-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙子癸巳与前观，官职三公卿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-b24e0ee439537c54002d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木若逢金主不伤，两府坐中堂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-49c9df1ffcc1a1992d14-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火若逢水主将权，为将镇戍边。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-58f762fca5c5c222da44-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金若逢火主大权，方面刺史官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-6c93a707f2635311b8f1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水若逢土入金局，宜作侍从下。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-0370639ca266ba48ed55-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土若逢木为正禄，八座三台福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-1077e397f640b7b7efe4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年得月禄不为喜，日贵取为主。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-7534d266ebf851cac52d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生逢贵人值孤寡，决定为僧也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-9837e9647d3104761077-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "空亡官禄遇贵人，淡服作高僧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-0f4bcfc8dd1ddcc4c636-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行无气守孤寡，必定作行者。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-51e1eed71a79e92644a0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "空亡刑害又逢囚，为僧及裹头。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-c6fe6b813822b2fe1005-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "欲知人命主有权，食神旺必全。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-24b045faafea4b8dc200-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "相冲阳刃再杀伤，必主上法场。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-0628cd329a501a534390-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "的杀若逢盘足坐，恶鬼死刑狱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-da5f5785b6aa614046f4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "麦田相逢共帝星，徒流定分明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-97bf2511d754db844c2f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大害当权多夭折，少年逢刃杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-49f4683f26ddc255b39a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日逢官鬼见重刑，恶死甚分明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-6be11e1a7b6e3100282a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "刃神劫煞两头居，早岁梦天衢。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-80f8e54e71fd7dc761ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马俱逢行绝地，劳困难逃避。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-04989184843158642639-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月若逢时与刑冲，根基定一空。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-385412823b087fe8355a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时遇官星生旺位，子孙成行序。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-d75bec47a3cf9de57aea-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "向禄临财官更期，贵显有家资。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-d52692bf13305bd6cc22-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日月纯官无财位，反主无官贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-7f55be84763d1bc626e4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "卯刑子位子刑卯，癸乙相刑贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-fb714b27fed68a2c0800-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子来冲午，未刑戌，甲乙逢申显贵名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-b8c7f2b4a315fe344957-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马俱绝又发财，人元剋出来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-2fd86885991cd4b5b451-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "得一分三缘何议，禄马飞天是。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-d52940f0c6fe65c48e0f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁合时日分两头，切须仔细求；君子若逢主奏对，常人主灾晦。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-cca696dc121f9b88b0c0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "心怀悔退成何事，重阳剥官位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-19994f6f9388a218b921-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "柱中有禄运逢财，金玉自天来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-dbd1dcd46e05aa13f419-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "言前能说贵与贱，亦须看大运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-faea8e64c1f0e3931fe5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大凡行运逢禄马，发跡为官也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-f16fcd3d38be2ca26d51-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天月二德为救解，百灾不为害。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-b1863b8677ab17ae0fa1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "向禄临财甚希奇，贵显主官貲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-43387eeb94b05f33226d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命中禄马同贵人，福禄进珠珍。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-777e2e544fae436a4b44-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵人君子坐刑煞，名成少年发。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-06d1409b4fb9e914eca2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴阳贵贱宜消息，熟晓于胸臆；日时身命许多般，一诀通变看。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "52-63853744f21b070bb585-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
